<title>CANADA: Canada sets Friday meeting for Zaire go-ahead.</title>
<headline>Canada sets Friday meeting for Zaire go-ahead.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A meeting will be held in Ottawa on Friday to give formal approval for a modified international humanitarian mission for eastern Zaire, Canada announced on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have now achieved an agreement,&quot; Canadian Foreign Minister Lloyd Axworthy said in a statement, adding that more than 20 nations had offered support.</p>
</text>
